UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1 WHERE "slug" IN ('baltimore', 'columbus', 'detroit', 'kansas-city');
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Baltimore''s listings span the wider metro. The Tiles Social Club hosts open play and lessons at cafes and other public venues, Severna Park Community Center runs a beginner MAHJ 101 course and guided open play, and Howard County Library holds a meet-up for all levels. Iris Pressman and other local teachers offer private and group lessons. Since play is spread across venues, check the calendar and how far you will need to travel before your first visit.' WHERE "slug" = 'baltimore';
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Columbus-area American Mahjong is led by teaching groups. The Poppy Pair runs classes and guided play around Central Ohio, and Let''s Get Mahj''d offers Mahjong 101 and 102 classes with open play and social events. Alice S. is another local teacher. Sessions move between venues such as breweries and country clubs, so confirm the location and whether a class or open play fits before you sign up. Beginners can start with a Mahjong 101 class.' WHERE "slug" = 'columbus';
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Metro Detroit has lessons and several open-play options. Mahjong Social Club Michigan offers Mahjong 101 classes and guided play, while libraries and churches such as Westland Public Library and Birmingham First UMC host open play. Katie Wallace and Mah Jongg Mommas teach across Southeast Michigan, and Mah Jongg Mommas also offers online lessons. Locations are spread across the suburbs, so check the address first. Beginners may prefer a class before joining open play.' WHERE "slug" = 'detroit';
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Kansas City''s listings include a club, a beginner course and several teachers. Kansas City Mahjong Club offers public lessons and guided open play at local venues, and the Park Hill District Office runs a two-session beginner course using the National Mah Jongg League card. Lauren Sinovic, Emily Levine and Val H. also teach, some online. Because venues are spread across the metro, check locations, and confirm the version taught, since one teacher also plays other styles.' WHERE "slug" = 'kansas-city';
